<section
  class="bg-[#ffe1b7] text-[#2b2b2b] mx-auto w-full min-h-[672px] p-20 flex flex-col items-start text-left gap-4"
>
  <h1
    class="font-['Raleway'] font-semibold text-[40px] leading-[48px] text-[#414141] m-0 max-w-[639px]"
  >
    One gesture can shape the future
  </h1>
  <p
    class="font-['Mulish'] font-normal text-[20px] leading-[32px] text-[#414141] m-0 max-w-[639px]"
  >
    <strong>ISDIN</strong> and <strong
      >World Congress of Dermatology 2027</strong
    > (WCD) have joined forces to create a global movement with a shared purpose:<strong
      >to inspire a future without skin cancer.</strong
    > This alliance is based on science, education, and a genuine commitment to prevention,
    with the aim of <strong
      >bringing daily sun protection to everyone, everywhere in the world.</strong
    >
  </p>
  <p
    class="font-['Mulish'] font-normal text-[20px] leading-[32px] text-[#414141] m-0 max-w-[639px]"
  >
    Now it's your turn to join: <strong
      >share a photo of yourself protecting your skin</strong
    > from the sun and be part of the movement. Participants will be entered a draw
    to win passes to experience WCD 2027. <strong
      >Together, for a future without skin cancer.</strong
    >
  </p>

  <a
    aria-label="button to join the challenge"
    href="#join"
    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#414141] text-white w-[313px] h-[56px] px-[32px] py-[16px] rounded-[2px] font-['Mulish'] text-[0.85rem] font-semibold tracking-[1.5px] no-underline box-border mt-[10px] cursor-default"
  >
    JOIN NOW
  </a>
</section>
